        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kayaaya, bamawisi bayoolya bana babo mukati kako, abalo bana bayoolya bamawisaabo, Njoomubeteka, abaabo basyeede mukati kako njoebamwaisya kumabazu oonse. ",
