        },
        {
          "text": "Mbubonya mbundi muumi, mbwaamba Mwami Jehova, mbumwasofwaazya cikombelo cangu azintu zyanu zivundusya azisesemya, ncobeni njoomukosola. Meso aangu taakooyoomufwida luse, nsikooyoomufwida luzyalo pe. ",
