          "text": "Cipanzi canu cimwi catatu ciyoojazigwa malwazi akumanisigwa apamba mukati kanu, acipanzi cimwi catatu ciyoojazigwa ipanga muzisi zimweengelede, acimwi catatu cisyeede njoocimwaisya kumabazu oonse akusomona ipanga kusule lyaco.",
